---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Why .monster Works for Bold Creative Brands | eDesigr.monster"
  description="When a new TLD beats a long .com: memorability, brand energy, and SEO reality for AI creative studios choosing .monster."
  canonicalPath="/blog/monster-tld-brandable-domains/"
>
  <Nav />
  <main id="main" class="pt-28 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[3px] text-cyan-400 font-extrabold mb-4">Branding • 4 min read</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl tracking-tight mb-6">Why .monster works for bold creative brands.</h1>
    <article class="space-y-5 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-[17px]">
      <p>Forward-thinking studios increasingly choose a <strong class="text-white">short, emotional new-TLD</strong> over a long, compromised .com. Three reasons:</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-white pt-4">1. Memorability beats familiarity</h2>
      <p>"eDesigr.monster" is a story in one breath. A 22-character .com with hyphens or filler words is forgotten before the pitch ends.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-white pt-4">2. Positioning signal</h2>
      <p>.monster signals you don't play small — exactly the energy generative-AI buyers (Midjourney-era creatives, prompt studios, NFT collectives) respond to.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-white pt-4">3. SEO reality</h2>
      <p>Google treats new gTLDs equally for ranking. What ranks is content, links, and brand search volume — all of which a memorable domain accelerates.</p>
      <div class="bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-7 mt-8">
        <p class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">Own the energy.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mb-4">eDesigr.monster — $95,000, escrow protected.</p>
        <a href="/#acquire" data-track="blog-tld-cta" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-[48px] px-6 rounded-2xl bg-white text-zinc-950 font-semibold">Make an offer</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
